 "timing_rationale": "Leading: paid subscriptions come before measurable use at scale, and card data arrives within weeks.",
 "tracker_interpretation": "Over half of tech-forward firms pay for AI, but the monthly gain has slowed to under half a point. Paid adoption is broad in this sample and flattening.",
 "unit": "share",
